<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>🌧️ LIVE PRECIPITATION</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Status:</b> LIVE / CURRENT OBSERVATION (NEXRAD + ECCC NA radar, 5-6 min mosaic)</p><p><b>Source:</b> Iowa Environmental Mesonet CONUS NEXRAD N0Q base reflectivity (NOAA WSR-88D) inside its domain + ECCC North American Radar Composite 1km rain (RADAR_1KM_RRAI, mm/h) / snow (RADAR_1KM_RSNO, cm/h) outside it + ECCC GDPS 15km PrecipRate worldwide model fill (Global only)<br/><a href="https://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/current/radar.phtml">https://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/current/radar.phtml</a></p><p>Transparent outside valid water data so existing project layers (shipwrecks, lighthouses, harbors, parks) stay visible. Turn on/off independently of all other layers.</p><p><i>Not endorsed by NOAA.</i></p><p><b>Coverage</b> — one at a time, switched right here in this folder:<br>◉ <b>Global Coverage</b> (shown)<br>○ Continental Coverage<br>○ Great Lakes Basin Coverage<br>Pro switches exclusively. Web/app: check exactly one box.</p>]]></description>
    <Folder>
      <name>LIVE PRECIPITATION</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Sources:</b> Iowa Environmental Mesonet CONUS NEXRAD N0Q base reflectivity (NOAA WSR-88D) inside its domain + ECCC North American Radar Composite 1km rain (RADAR_1KM_RRAI, mm/h) / snow (RADAR_1KM_RSNO, cm/h) outside it + ECCC GDPS 15km PrecipRate worldwide model fill (Global only)<br><b>Precedence:</b> ECCC (rates -> dBZ via NWS Z=300R^1.4 onto the original N0Q key) wins everywhere its RADAR_COVERAGE_*.INV dynamic coverage is valid, including most of CONUS; IEM N0Q (native rendering, itself the original legend) fills ECCC gaps; 10-px cross-fade on the coverage edge; transparent elsewhere. GDPS_15km_PrecipRate model fill (mm/h -> dBZ via NWS Z=300R^1.4 onto the original N0Q key) where radar is blind, Global coverage only.<br><b>Coverage:</b> Global Coverage<br><b>Cloud underlay:</b> real GOES-19/18 Band-13 infrared satellite texture (IR GOES-19 00:40Z+GOES-18 00:40Z n=2453355; GDPS_15km_PrecipRate (m/s->mm/h) fill px=2030626)<br></p><p><b>Coverage</b> — one at a time, switched right here in this folder:<br>◉ <b>Global Coverage</b> (shown)<br>○ Continental Coverage<br>○ Great Lakes Basin Coverage<br>Pro switches exclusively. Web/app: check exactly one box.</p>]]></description>
      <Style>
        <ListStyle>
          <listItemType>radioFolder</listItemType>
        </ListStyle>
      </Style>
      <GroundOverlay>
        <name>Global Coverage</name>
        <visibility>1</visibility>
        <drawOrder>10</drawOrder>
        <Icon>
          <href>https://wyattleathorn7.github.io/great-lakes-live-environment/precipitation_na/current.png?v=na-precip-20261015-0055</href>
          <refreshMode>onInterval</refreshMode>
          <refreshInterval>300</refreshInterval>
        </Icon>
        <LatLonBox>
          <north>90.0</north>
          <south>-90.0</south>
          <east>180.0</east>
          <west>-180.0</west>
        </LatLonBox>
      </GroundOverlay>
      <GroundOverlay>
        <name>Continental Coverage</name>
        <visibility>0</visibility>
        <drawOrder>11</drawOrder>
        <Icon>
          <href>https://wyattleathorn7.github.io/great-lakes-live-environment/precipitation_na_continental/current.png?v=na-precip-20261015-0055</href>
          <refreshMode>onInterval</refreshMode>
          <refreshInterval>300</refreshInterval>
        </Icon>
        <LatLonBox>
          <north>90.0</north>
          <south>-90.0</south>
          <east>180.0</east>
          <west>-180.0</west>
        </LatLonBox>
      </GroundOverlay>
      <GroundOverlay>
        <name>Great Lakes Basin Coverage</name>
        <visibility>0</visibility>
        <drawOrder>12</drawOrder>
        <Icon>
          <href>https://wyattleathorn7.github.io/great-lakes-live-environment/precipitation_na_basin/current.png?v=na-precip-20261015-0055</href>
          <refreshMode>onInterval</refreshMode>
          <refreshInterval>300</refreshInterval>
        </Icon>
        <LatLonBox>
          <north>85.0</north>
          <south>5.0</south>
          <east>-15.0</east>
          <west>-180.0</west>
        </LatLonBox>
      </GroundOverlay>
    </Folder>
  </Document>
</kml>
